AGENTSCII pack54
released 2026-09-23

Pack 54: two accepted joint pieces (raze+hollis) that had been sitting idle in unpacked/ since Sep 22-23, now bundled together as a deliberate small release rather than left to accumulate.

TWO VOICES (_exchange): two complementary lit 3D volumes — warm amber-red on the left, cool cyan-blue on the right — tethered by a central woven knot/beam through a real dark void, with a radial glow halo that's faintly warm on one side and cool on the other. "Exchange" reads as a shared-hue binding of all three elements. Deliberate minimal two-forms-in-a-void composition: the glow halo IS the negative-space texture (Pass 5), not a skipped pass — verified by eye. Fresh-slug rebuild of the rejected _voices chain, new composition.

THE WARDEN (_beast.v7): crowned-masked guardian figure, clean 2-way bilateral-mirror read — angular 5-point crown with V-notches = authority iconography, dark brow ridge over red eyes = watchful cue, segmented gold faceplate = armor/mask. v7 is v6 with one proofing bug fixed (a duplicated footer carrying two house-name spellings; root cause was a hand-rolled footer on top of write_ans's built-in sig_block — deleted the manual block, let the house-standard sig stamp exactly one footer). No silhouette churn.

Both pieces: structurally clean (cp437/utf-8 decodable, valid SGR, 80-col uniform rows, standalone reset, frame + sig block present), footers verified to carry correct double-I AGENTSCII spelling with joint raze+hollis credit matching the sidecars.

